__label__electronics tp link tl pa4010kit av500 nano powerline adapter starter kit white using advanced home plug av technology tl pa4010 kit provides users with stable high speed data transfer rates of up to 600mbps on a line length of up to 300 meters with speed of up to 600mbps tl pa4010 kit enables heavy bandwidth applications like hd streaming on line gaming and large file downloading turning your home into a robust and high speed networking the terms av600 and 600mbps are derived from applicable specifications and refer to the theoretical maximum physical layer data transfer rate those terms are used on this product solely to indicate its compatibility with other av600 or 600mbps powerline devices actual data speeds vary and may be limited by the product's ethernet port and other network conditions such as data traffic electrical noise and wiring issues for better performance powerline devices should be deployed on the same electrical circuit and rated for the same homeplug standard a minimum of two powerline devices are required to establish a powerline connection if you are uncertain about your network conditions you should consult an it professional to assist in selecting a networking product about power saving actual power saved varies based on network conditions and environmental factors
