al for uniform heat distribution which means that your entire room will heat up within a short span of time this also means that you can save on your electricity bill the bajaj minor room heater has a nickel chrome plated mesh grid and has a bright nickel chrome plated reflector the heater s reflecting surface is corrugated and the heater is orange in a material made of cast iron this heater is approved by bis isi marked ensuring a standard of high quality this heater is economical apart from being strong and durable one of the other striking features of this heater is that it has a single heating element the heating element is effective in extremely cold temperatures too product featurescomes with a bright nickel chrome plated reflector comes with a superior heating element comes with a 2 year warranty approved by bis isi marked has wattage of 1 000 watts
